## Required Roles
- Create: STREAM_AUTHOR (Topic Author in the Self-Service UI) or STREAM_ADMIN. `owners` must also be a group you are a
  member of. Otherwise Platform Manager answers "You do not belong to this group/team."
- Change or delete: STREAM_ADMIN, or a member of the owner group (a group manager when the tenant allows only resource managers to change resources).

## Limitations
- Leaving out `properties` keeps the properties the topic has. `properties = {}` removes them.
- `name`, `key_type`, `value_type`, `key_schema` and `value_schema` cannot change while the topic has an `axual_topic_config`: Platform Manager refuses it, for example with "Name cannot be changed because the stream has active stream configuration." Remove the topic configs first.

